I & Agentic AI Architect Bootcamp","TagLine":"Master Python, ML.NET, Azure AI, AWS AI, GenAI, AI Agents, Claude & ChatGPT","CourseCount":0,"Url":"/bootcamp/multi-cloud-net-ai-agentic-ai-architect-bootcamp","MobileBanner":"https://dotnettrickscloud.blob.core.windows.net/uploads/CourseImages/multicloudnetaiaiagentsdeveloperbootcamp-mobile.png","FooterDetails":"<ul class=\"job-description\">\r\n    <li>AI/ML &amp; Gen AI Development with Python, ML.NET, Azure AI, AWS AI, Claude &amp; ChatGPT</li>\r\n    <li>Build Multi-Agent Systems with Foundry, Bedrock, Microsoft Agent Framework &amp; LangGraph</li>\r\n    <li>200+ Hands-on Labs, Quick Notes, Skill Tests &amp; Interview Q&amp;A</li>\r\n    <li>Build 8 Real-World Industry Projects</li>\r\n</ul>","SmallBanner":"https://dotnettrickscloud.blob.core.windows.net/uploads/CourseImages/multicloudnetaiagenticaiarchitectbootcamp-small.jpg","VideoCount":0,"ProjectCount":6,"Duration":"30:00:00","Paths":null},{"Id":1392,"Name":".NET AI/ML Architect Bootcamp","TagLine":"Master Software Architecture, System Design, Microservices, Docker/K8s & ML.NET","CourseCount":0,"Url":"/bootcamp/net-ai-ml-architect-bootcamp","MobileBanner":"https://dotnettrickscloud.blob.core.windows.net/uploads/CourseImages/netaimlarchitectbootcamp-mobile.png","FooterDetails":"<ul class=\"job-description\">\r\n    <li>Software Architecture, Design Patterns &amp; Enterprise System Design</li>\r\n    <li>.NET AI/ML, Azure Cloud, Docker/K8s &amp; Microservices Architecture</li>\r\n    <li>200+ Hands-on Labs, Quick Notes, Practice Tests &amp; Interview Q&amp;A</li>\r\n    <li>Build 6 Enterprise-grade Projects</li>\r\n</ul>","SmallBanner":"https://dotnettrickscloud.blob.core.windows.net/uploads/CourseImages/netaimlarchitectbootcamp-small.png","VideoCount":0,"ProjectCount":6,"Duration":"30:00:00","Paths":null}],"AI/ML":[{"Id":1424,"Name":"Multi-Cloud .NET AI & Agentic AI Architect Bootcamp","TagLine":"Master Python, ML.NET, Azure AI, AWS AI, GenAI, AI Agents, Claude 