Lakh+">2 Lakh+</b><small>professionals trained</small><li><i class="bi bi-terminal-fill" aria-hidden=true></i><b data-count=1200 data-suffix=+>1200&#x2B;</b><small>hands-on labs</small><li><i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow" aria-hidden=true></i><b data-count=93 data-suffix=%>93%</b><small>hired within 9 months</small></ul></div><div class=hh-stage id=hh-stage aria-label="A look inside ScholarHat"><div class=hh-orb aria-hidden=true><i></i><i></i></div><div class=hh-win><div class=hh-bar><div class=hh-tabs role=tablist aria-label="What you get"><span class=hh-glider aria-hidden=true></span> <button type=button role=tab class="hh-tab on" data-i=0 aria-selected=true><i class="bi bi-box-seam-fill" aria-hidden=true></i><span>Projects</span></button> <button type=button role=tab class=hh-tab data-i=1 aria-selected=false><i class="bi bi-camera-video-fill" aria-hidden=true></i><span>Live</span></button> <button type=button role=tab class=hh-tab data-i=2 aria-selected=false><i class="bi bi-terminal-fill" aria-hidden=true></i><span>Labs</span></button> <button type=button role=tab class=hh-tab data-i=3 aria-selected=false><i class="bi bi-journal-bookmark-fill" aria-hidden=true></i><span>Notes</span></button> <button type=button role=tab class=hh-tab data-i=4 aria-selected=false><i class="bi bi-ui-checks" aria-hidden=true></i><span>Tests</span></button> <button type=button role=tab class=hh-tab data-i=5 aria-selected=false><i class="bi bi-chat-left-text-fill" aria-hidden=true></i><span>Q&amp;A</span></button></div></div><div class=hh-scenes><div class="hh-scene on" data-i=0 role=tabpanel><div class="hh-row hh-row--head"><span class=hh-tile><i class="bi bi-box-seam-fill" aria-hidden=true></i></span><div><h3>Enterprise AI Chatbot</h3><p><span class=hh-chip>Advanced project</span><span class=hh-chip>Azure OpenAI</span><span class=hh-chip>RAG</span></div></div><div class=hh-proj><img src=/images/projects/AzureAiChatGpt.png alt="Enterprise AI Chatbot project" width=1962 height=802 loading=lazy></div><div class=hh-skgrid aria-hidden=true><div><i class="sk sk--bar"></i><i class="sk sk--bar s"></i></div><div><i class="sk sk--bar"></i><i class="sk sk--bar s"></i></div></div></div><div class=hh-scene data-i=1 role=tabpanel><div class="hh-row hh-row--head"><span class=hh-tile><i class="bi bi-camera-video-fill" aria-hidden=true></i></span><div><h3>Live Doubt sessions with Expert Mentor</h3><p><span class="hh-chip hh-chip--live"><i></i>Live</span><span class=hh-chip>Bootcamps</span><span class=hh-chip>AI/ML included</span></div></div><div class=hh-zoom aria-hidden=true><div class=hh-zoom__stage><span class=hh-rec><i></i>REC</span><div class=hh-zoom__share><i class="sk sk--bar" style=width:34%></i> <i class="sk sk--bar" style=width:62%></i> <i class="sk sk--bar" style=width:48%></i> <i class="sk sk--bar" style=width:70%></i> <i class="sk sk--bar" style=width:40%></i></div><span class=hh-zoom__name><i class="bi bi-mic-fill"></i>Mentor</span></div><div class=hh-zoom__strip><div class=speak><i class="sk sk--dot"></i><i class="sk sk--bar s"></i></div><div><i class="sk sk--dot"></i><i class="sk sk--bar s"></i></div><div><i class="sk sk--dot"></i><i class="sk sk--bar s"></i></div><div><i class="sk sk--dot"></i><i class="sk sk--bar s"></i></div></div></div></div><div class=hh-scene data-i=2 role=tabpanel><div class="hh-row hh-row--head"><span class=hh-tile><i class="bi bi-terminal-fill" aria-hidden=true></i></span><div><h3>AWS: Build a Knowledge Base with Amazon Bedrock</h3><p><span class=hh-chip>Guided lab</span><span class=hh-chip>38 steps</span><span class=hh-chip>AWS sandbox</span></div></div><div class=hh-meter aria-hidden=true><i style=--w:22%></i></div><ol class=hh-steps><li class=now><b>8</b><span>Configure AWS credentials</span><small>4 min</small><li class=skl aria-hidden=true><i class="sk sk--dot"></i><i class="sk sk--bar"></i><li class=skl aria-hidden=true><i class="sk sk--dot"></i><i class="sk sk--bar m"></i><li class=skl aria-hidden=true><i class="sk sk--dot"></i><i class="sk sk--bar s"></i></ol><div class=hh-code><i class="bi bi-chevron-right" aria-hidden=true></i><span class=hh-cmd><span>aws sts get-caller-identity</span></span></div></div><div class=hh-scene data-i=3 role=tabpanel><div class="hh-row hh-row--head"><span class=hh-tile><i class="bi bi-journal-bookmark-fill" aria-hidden=true></i></span><div><h3>Azure AI Search Architecture and Components</h3><p><span class=hh-chip>Quick note</span><span class=hh-chip>Revise in minutes</span></div></div><div class=hh-note><i class="bi bi-bookmark-fill" aria-hidden=true></i> <span class=hh-lines aria-hidden=true><i class=sk></i><i class=sk></i><i class=sk></i><i class=sk></i></span></div><div class=hh-skgrid aria-hidden=true><div><i class="sk sk--bar"></i><i class="sk sk--bar s"></i></div><div><i class="sk sk--bar"></i><i class="sk sk--bar s"></i></div></div></div><div class=hh-scene data-i=4 role=tabpanel><div class="hh-row hh-row--head"><span class=hh-tile><i class="bi bi-robot" aria-hidden=true></i></span><div><h3>AI/ML Skill Test</h3><p><span class=hh-chip>MCQ</span> <span class=hh-chip>Instant score</span> <span class=hh-chip>AI Skills</span></div></div><div class=hh-mcq><h4>What does RAG improve in LLMs?</h4><ul><li><b>A</b> Training speed<li class=ans><b>B</b> Response accuracy <i class="bi bi-check-lg" aria-hidden=true></i><li><b>C</b> Model size<li><b>D</b> GPU performance</ul></div><div class="hh-skgrid hh-skgrid--rows" aria-hidden=true><div><i class="sk sk--bar"></i><i class="sk sk--bar s"></i></div></div></div><div class=hh-scene data-i=5 role=tabpanel><div class="hh-row hh-row--head"><span class=hh-tile><i class="bi bi-chat-left-text-fill" aria-hidden=true></i></span><div><h3>Interview Q&amp;A guides</h3><p><span class=hh-chip>Interview ready</span><span class=hh-chip>Earn your certificate</span></div></div><ul class=hh-qa><li class=open><div><span>Microsoft Azure Well-Architected Framework</span><i class="bi bi-chevron-down" aria-hidden=true></i></div><span class=hh-lines aria-hidden=true><i class=sk></i><i class=sk></i><i class=sk></i></span><li class=skl aria-hidden=true><i class="sk sk--bar m"></i><li class=skl aria-hidden=true><i class="sk sk--bar"></i></ul></div></div></div><div class=hh-float id=hh-float aria-hidden=true><span class="f on"><i class="bi bi-box-seam-fill"></i><b>Real projects</b><small>portfolio ready</small></span> <span class=f><i class="bi bi-camera-video-fill"></i><b>Live video classes</b><small>with Microsoft MVPs</small></span> <span class=f><i class="bi bi-terminal-fill"></i><b>Step by step</b><small>real cloud sandbox</small></span> <span class=f><i class="bi bi-journal-bookmark-fill"></i><b>Quick notes</b><small>for every topic</small></span> <span class=f><i class="bi bi-ui-checks"></i><b>Skill tests</b><small>MCQs for every course</small></span> <span class=f><i class="bi bi-patch-check-fill"></i><b>Interview Q&amp;A</b><small>guides included</small></span></div></div></div><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap" rel=stylesheet><link href="/css/home-alumni.css?v=A6-8xcCYUxiNZr_e8XkIUSN0SPXfMDSu7vECliXrBwI" rel=stylesheet><section class=al id=alumni aria-label="Companies where our learners work"><div class=al-bar><p class=al-since><i class="bi bi-patch-check-fill" aria-hidden=true></i><b>Since 2015</b><span>Training individuals and corporate teams</span><ul class=al-social aria-label="ScholarHat on social media"><li><a href=https://www.youtube.com/@ScholarHat target=_blank rel="nofollow noopener"><i class="bi bi-youtube" aria-hidden=true></i><b>41.5K</b> subscribers</a><li><a href=https://www.linkedin.com/company/scholarhatx target=_blank rel="nofollow noopener"><i class="bi bi-linkedin" aria-hidden=true></i><b>21.9K</b> followers</a><li><a href=https://www.instagram.com/scholarhatx target=_blank rel="nofollow noopener"><i class="bi bi-instagram" aria-hidden=true></i><b>13.6K</b> followers</a></ul></div><d